                <p id="selected-department-info" style="font-size: 1.1em; font-weight: bold;">선택된 학과가 없습니다.</p>
                <a id="department-announcement-link" href="#" target="_blank" class="button" style="display: none; margin-top: 10px;">공지사항 바로가기</a>
